<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Blacksmith Greed Skill</Major>
    <Description>Greed is a skill to auto pick up item within 2x2 cells.

Set Greed skill in key C.

You can just train with mouse click and free your hand from clicking the keyboard.

This macro will let the greed skill triggered every 15 seconds, it is about right for each pile of items after killling 1 group of mobs.

Feel free to edit the intervals accordingly, don't forget to set the operation mode to "run until press again".

Thank you Keyran.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 6 1
Delay 113 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 15 s</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Ragnarok</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>